WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Money moves. Currencies differ.
Your customers cross borders. Their payments need to cross currencies.
A global payment needs more than a dollar token.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Different currencies. One on-chain exchange.
FX means exchanging one currency for another. On-chain FX does it with stablecoins.
Stablecoins are tokens designed to track a currency’s value.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Match off-chain. Settle on-chain.
Sera matches stablecoin orders off-chain. Trades settle through Ethereum smart contracts.
An exchange for stablecoins. A settlement layer to build on.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Build around better money movement.
Programmatic access. Verifiable settlement. Funds held in smart contracts, not by the matching engine.
Availability, liquidity and costs depend on the market and network.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Your next corridor could start here.
Stablecoin issuer? Payment provider? Neobank? Let’s explore the currencies your customers need.
Discuss liquidity, FX conversion and settlement integration.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Which currencies are you connecting?
Meet Sera on Telegram. Bring your corridor. Start a conversation.
Scan to watch again and open the Sera community.
